From 6a6f8d972d2e1b5a7bb99254f35558ed54ddad47 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Rogers <gnathonic@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 15:36:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fused winograd43: 32 KB shared-memory config (Apple
 limit; also faster on RDNA2), Apple keeps the stock path

- WINO_ICC/WINO_OCH #defines pick (16,8)=55 KB or (8,4)=27.6 KB; compiled from the embedded
  source via the new get_layer_shader_source(); the small config is the default where
  maxComputeSharedMemorySize is 32 KB and on GPUs without cooperative matrix (RX 6900 XT
  1.01 -> 0.88 ms). NCNN_WINO_LDS=32|64 overrides. Pipeline-creation failure falls back to
  the 3-kernel path instead of crashing.
- Apple/MoltenVK runs the fused kernel ~30% slower than stock ncnn (M2 Pro), so vendor 0x106B
  keeps the stock path unless NCNN_WINO_FUSED=2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/gpu.cpp                                   |  9 +++
 src/gpu.h                                     |  2 +
 src/layer/vulkan/convolution_vulkan.cpp       | 51 +++++++++++--
 ...lution_pack4_3x3s1d1_winograd43_fused.comp | 76 +++++++++++--------
 4 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 38 deletions(-)

